      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223415/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk and pudding mix in a large bowl until softly set, about 2 minutes. The pudding will thicken as it stands.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xeXbK7uKv7_figKbvd5qZKKxkEk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223415-dirt-pudding-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-8ad1f62baf8641d1a7c04c362ab7a924.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223415/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat confectioners' sugar, cream cheese, and butter in a separate bowl until smooth and creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xDFlrUEcN5C-6twiEwY4BvdrsqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223415-dirt-pudding-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-35d525764f8b43b3ad218ffefc46cc66.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223415/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cream cheese mixture into pudding until thoroughly combined; gently fold in frozen whipped topping.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
